id: elemental-blade
name: Elemental Blade
kind: crafting
types: physical, energy
slots: 2
special: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Special. An Elemental Profile chosen when it is made, added to attacks with it through the
  Multi-Profile Super Profile.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: Upon creating this Weapon, select a Profile with ‘Elemental’ in the name. Apply the
  Multi-Profile Super Profile to any Attacking Maneuvers you use, with the Profile selected for
  the Multi-Profile Super Profile being the Elemental Profile you selected. If it meets the
  Prerequisites, also apply the Compressed Element Disadvantage to those Attacking Maneuvers.
text: >
  Elemental Blade: This Weapon is charged with elemental energy.
  –Weapon Type: Physical/Energy
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 2
  –Effects: Upon creating this Weapon, select a Profile with ‘Elemental’ in the name. Apply the
  Multi-Profile Super Profile to any Attacking Maneuvers you use, with the Profile selected for
  the Multi-Profile Super Profile being the Elemental Profile you selected. If it meets the
  Prerequisites, also apply the Compressed Element Disadvantage to those Attacking Maneuvers.

---

# --- What is not built ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Everything it does. An attack carries one Profile in this system, and neither the Multi-Profile
# Super Profile nor the Compressed Element Disadvantage is in it. When they are, by the table's
# rulings: only attacks made with this Weapon; the Elemental Profile chosen when it is made; and,
# where the attack already has a Super Profile, the player chooses which.
